sequenceDiagram
  participant author as Author
  participant ci as Build queue
  participant reviewer as Reviewer
  author->>ci: push the branch
  ci-->>author: checks passed
  author->>reviewer: request review
  alt changes requested
    reviewer-->>author: comments
    author->>ci: push fixes
  else approved
    reviewer-->>author: approve
    author->>ci: merge when green
  end
